'''Cyclops''' (サイクロプス, '''Saikuropusu''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Castle & Dragon Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 4.6 Update|Version 4.6]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Cyclops
|appearance = [[Castle & Dragon Collaboration Event]]
|image = E 220.png
|money drop = 1,500円 - 5,925円
}}

==Enemy==
One of the stronger enemies that appears in the [[Castle & Dragon Collaboration Event|Castle & Dragon Collaboration]] stages. This enemy supports high health, moderate attack and long range, meaning that it is able to outrange a majority of attackers. However, it has low attack power, DPS and movement speed.

==Strategy==
Higher ranged units such as [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]] or quick hitting units such as [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Lion Cat]] and [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Bullet Train Cat]] will need to be used to defeat this foe, since not many things can outrange it other than [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|ubers]]. Even some long-ranged attackers like  [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Leg Cat]] and even [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|King Dragon Cat]] are outranged by 20 range, but certain [[:Category:Tanker-class Cats|tankers]] can also be used since his DPS is not high.

